    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">When to Apply for Spanish Health Insurance: Timing for Visa and Arrival</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Getting the timing of your Spanish health insurance right is one of the most commonly mishandled parts of the NLV application. Apply too early and the policy may expire before your visa interview or before you use it. Apply too late and you'll need to rush before your appointment. Here's exactly how to time it.</p>
  </div>
